WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.900
A possible adverse reaction is observed in a clinical setting in Patiala.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.380
The information enters the appropriate pharmacovigilance workflow.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.880
For the safety team, this is one piece of a much larger evidence picture.

4
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.680
Across Company A's authorised safety evidence, similar events begin to appear.

5
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.460
Gurpreet Singh, a safety analyst in Mohali, asks Hygelis to investigate

6
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.980
a potential hepatic safety signal associated with Narevia.

7
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.880
Hygelis begins an agentic investigation.

8
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.800
It finds related cases, extracts common characteristics, searches relevant

9
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.800
medical literature and compares historical patterns.

10
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.300
It also checks alternative explanations, identifies conflicting evidence

11
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.980
and traces each finding back to its source.

12
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.440
The result is not a black-box answer.

13
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.620
It is a structured investigation package showing the evidence, the reasoning,

14
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.960
the uncertainty and the conflicts.

15
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:54.920
Then Hygelis stops.

16
00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:59.300
A qualified safety professional reviews the evidence and decides what happens

17
00:00:59.300 --> 00:00:59.820
next.

18
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.460
AI investigates.

19
00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.420
Qualified humans decide.
